WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 1: Open Ordering → Order history. Filter by dates, supplier or order reference and choose View order.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Step 2: To correct a placed order, select Edit order. Change items, quantities, unit prices, reference, shared notes or separate supplier notes, then select Save changes.

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:23.583
Step 3: To add a missed order, choose Record past order, enter its original date and use the supplier/category cards to add items.

4
00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:30.708
Step 4: Review quantities and historical prices, then choose Save to history. This records the order without emailing the supplier.

5
00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:36.708
Step 5: To remove an incorrect order, open its details, select Delete order and confirm.
